WEBVTT - MR. MAS Ep1 Act Four v5, audio description (kind: descriptions)

NOTE clock: act (offset +0.000 s from the act clock). Source: captions/tools/access_v5_src.json; script: ep01-act4-v5.ad-script.md.

AD01
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.500
November 17, noon, Las Vegas. A board video call: Join.

AD02
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:07.250
A blueprint: How to fire a CEO.

AD03
00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:28.900
Stamps: votes, zero. Equity, zero.

AD04
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.350
Step one: noon, video call. He clicks Join.

AD05
00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:35.350
The call, silent on his side. Alyi speaks.

AD06
00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:41.650
A dialog: OK, Cancel. An arrow tagged Alyi moves onto Cancel.

AD07
00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:45.200
His tile drops out: You've been removed from the meeting.

AD08
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.100
His phone suggests: super.

AD09
00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:50.533
Night. He carves a third mark in his desk.

AD10
00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:54.550
The Orb's light counts the marks.

AD11
00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.350
Tpool, his first company. Two staff revolts. Reported.

AD12
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.200
Marks two and three. The Orb: rewinding. The board's side.

AD13
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.200
11:59. He joins.

AD14
00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:16.790
His tile is still.

AD15
00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:23.390
Only his audio is left.

AD16
00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.150
Nobody looks up. Her pen ticks step one.

AD17
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.950
No one answers. She posts it.

AD18
00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:07.433
The staff all-hands.

AD19
00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:22.533
Evening. Gerg posts: I quit.

AD20
00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:37.100
November 18. Hearts pour in. His post: sorta like reading your own eulogy while you're still alive.

AD21
00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:08.608
She looks at the blank step four.

AD22
00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:14.000
She dials. Split screen: Mario, runs the rival lab, reported.

AD23
00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:34.864
A second phone: Nozama.

AD24
00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:43.550
Lobby camera, November 19: Mas, in a guest badge.

AD25
00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:55.800
He walks out.

AD26
00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:59.350
Night. The spotlight swings to Ttemme, who ran a streaming site.

AD27
00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:14.125
He reads a sealed folder, turned away.

AD28
00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:23.867
11:53 PM. The wall turns Macrosoft blue. A door opens: Tasya, the landlord.

AD29
00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:44.900
Tasya lifts a sign: Mas, Gerg, and an arrow pointing out.

AD30
00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:49.250
She writes a question mark. Mada says nothing.

AD31
00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:51.050
A card: What they didn't know.

AD32
00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:54.400
November 20, 2:06 AM. His side.

AD33
00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:58.250
Rima's post: NopeAI is nothing without its people.

AD34
00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:03.300
Gerg's tile rings.

AD35
00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:38.500
Alyi, reported.

AD36
00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:44.525
A check slides out of a slot.

AD37
00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:49.658
Void if CEO missing.

AD38
00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:55.200
Gerg looks up.

AD39
00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:02.400
A door rises behind him. A key turns.

AD40
00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:21.100
The board's call. Employee tiles pile in: 745 of 770.

AD41
00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.108
Alyi's tile is shoved off.

AD42
00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:28.050
The quiet vote's black tile goes. Mada doesn't move.

AD43
00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:31.200
Mada: last firer standing.

AD44
00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:38.717
Alyi posts: I deeply regret my participation in the board's actions. I never intended to harm NopeAI.

AD45
00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:50.850
The bullpen: packed boxes, coats on.

AD46
00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:03.533
Mas looks at the floor.

AD47
00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:10.200
November 21, 10 PM. Terb, the new chair, with an extinguisher.

AD48
00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:13.600
They look around.

AD49
00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:45.800
Mada's spinner stops. He nods. Terb stamps it.

AD50
00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:50.450
Gerg posts: Returning to NopeAI and getting back to coding tonight.

AD51
00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:53.500
Ttemme posts: I am deeply pleased by this result.

AD52
00:07:56.350 --> 00:08:01.100
The hourglass shatters. The lobby sign: Days since someone tried to fire Mas: zero.

AD53
00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:05.400
The dialog again. Cancel is greyed out and refuses the click.

AD54
00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:10.900
November 22. A steel vault, stenciled Q-star, hums.

AD55
00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:20.250
Reported: researchers wrote of a breakthrough called Q-star.

AD56
00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:21.825
November 29.

AD57
00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:34.400
Alyi's nameplate comes off; his door stays shut.

AD58
00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:37.950
A Macrosoft chair unfolds: observer, non-voting.

